WEBVTT

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.370
G'morning!

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.040
Good morning.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.160
Thank you for coming, Kano-san.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.790
Thanks for inviting me.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.080
You know you can stay overnight with us, too.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.160
No thanks, I'd rather stay at home.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.290
Good morning.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.580
Sup?

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.450
Okay, everyone's here.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.500
Leave your bags in here,
then let's go to the Student Council room.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.750
Yes ma'am.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.540
It feels like forever since I last saw you.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.160
It's only been 10 days since summer vacation started.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.580
I'm going to enjoy these 3 days with you.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:10.330
Morning rays shine through swaying branches

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.200
On this road lined with trees

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:23.790
I can hear your familiar voice saying "Good morning"

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.500
Inside that locked glass box

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:35.500
I wonder what's been hidden

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:41.700
A tale that has begun

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:46.370
I want to know more about your world

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:52.500
I brushed against those fingers by chance

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:57.080
But now I'm holding on to them

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:00.540
Your strengths and weaknesses

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:07.080
I'll embrace all of them

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:13.120
Tightly

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.370
I can't remember anything.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.370
Nothing at all, not even who I am.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.540
Apparently, I'm in high school.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.660
The girl with amnesia desperately wants
to know more about herself.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.160
My family members include a mother, father and younger brother.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.250
I got caught in an accident while on my way to school.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.330
During her hospitalization, she questions
all of the visitors who come to see her.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.120
Although my life was saved, I lost my memories.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:38.700
However...

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:42.700
Um...

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:48.410
Everyone relied on you.
You were always smiling and so friendly.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.330
Um, we're all waiting for you to come back.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.200
Although you're my big sis,
I never saw much of you at home.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:59.790
I don't even remember the last time
we talked to each other.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:03.000
You never showed this side of yourself to anyone else,

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.580
but when you were with me, you were a big crybaby
who always needed a shoulder to lean on.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.870
I thought if I asked the people who knew me,

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.000
Each person she spoke to had a completely
different image of her as a person.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.700
it would be easy to find out who I really am.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.580
The girl decides to act out each of the roles she once
filled, hoping it will bring her memories back.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.790
Eventually it comes time for her
to be released from the hospital.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.830
Among the three personalities,
she chooses only one to adopt.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:29.950
What's wrong?

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.620
Is this ending really the right one?

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.830
The main character settles on becoming
the person her lover knew, right?

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.580
Something just feels off about it.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.410
Though to be honest,
I'm not sure exactly why I feel that way.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:51.950
Unlike classmates or family, her lover is a person
that she actually chose to be together with.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:56.830
In the end, making that choice was...
well, I think the audience will be satisfied.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:04.000
If you're going to change it,
please let us know as soon as you can.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.870
I'm sorry!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.870
We're counting on you, big shot!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.790
Oh, come off it.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.000
And so...

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.660
our study camp continued,
with no exciting developments.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:21.750
Somehow, we all managed
to stay focused on rehearsing the show.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.790
The thought of staying 2 whole nights at school
with the other members of the council,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.330
filled the air with a nervous excitement
as the day went on.

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.580
Everything ended up going
exactly according to schedule,

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.040
and our first day came to an end.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.540
I'm beat!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.910
Good work today.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.290
Oh, I didn't realize it was so late.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.830
We should go take a bath soon.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.700
There's not much time left, so we have to hurry.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.450
Sayaka, it's bath time.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.750
Oh... right.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.910
Do you think the baths here have shampoo available?

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.330
This place was built for group bathing, right?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:09.450
Oh, I'm not sure. You should probably bring your own, just in case.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.870
Do I really want to go in with them?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:17.500
Well, it's not like this is my first time going into
a public bath or a ladies dressing room.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.250
Shoot, I forgot to bring a brush with me.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:15.830
You can borrow mine.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:16.870
Thank you.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:22.160
Usually, I don't react when other girls
get naked in those situations...

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.910
...but I'm not confident that will be
the same when Touko is involved.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.500
Actually...

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.580
Of course I'm going to react! There's no doubt!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.910
Senpai!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.870
We're going.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.540
Sayaka, hurry up.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.250
O-okay! I'll be right there!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.580
But more than anything,
I don't want to leave those two alone in there!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:55.410
All righty.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.040
You're quick!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:05.370
What's making you two so embarrassed all of a sudden?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.790
Actually, I'd say you're not embarrassed enough.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:11.200
I've been to plenty of overnight camps before,
so this is nothing.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.750
Right now, I can't afford to hesitate even for a second!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:19.120
I have to make the first move before either of them
has the time to get any ideas!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.620
No problem. No problem at all.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.290
Even if she looks at me, or I look at her...

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.160
I'm headed in.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:32.830
...it's no big deal.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.330
I love huge baths like these!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.160
I'd love to go to a proper hot spring.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.080
Hot springs are the best.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:52.660
Yuu...

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.910
She's bigger... than I thought.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.540
No, no, no!

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:03.200
I didn't plan this study camp so
I could get away with anything sneaky!

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:05.000
I can't let myself feel guilty about it!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.950
Study camps are...

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.040
...spectacular.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.950
Camps are fun and all, but splitting up
at night makes it too quiet.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.620
I suppose so.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.620
I wonder what they're talking
about over on the girl's side.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.910
Those three, huh?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.950
Those three are probably...

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.620
...having a ton of fun!

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.620
Okay! Time to mount a sneak attack!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.950
You have fun with that.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.120
I-I'm just pulling your leg.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.250
Sayaka?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.040
Huh?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.910
Wait! Why did you take my picture?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.250
It's a rare sighting of the "Glasses Sayaka"!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.200
Delete it!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.540
No way!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.540
Come on!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.500
Hold on, Yuu!

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.250
Why are you the one taking pictures now?!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.790
Because these are super rare!

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:17.790
Delete them!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.290
Hey! It's time for lights-out!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.370
Go to sleep girls.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.120
Yes ma'am.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.160
Don't you think it's too dark? I can't see a thing.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.160
I'm the type that can't sleep unless it's pitch black.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.830
I'm the type that sleeps with a small nightlight on.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.700
I don't sleep with any lights on.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.410
The majority has spoken.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:00.830
Touko is sleeping close enough that...
I could just reach out and touch her.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.830
But if I did that, it would be the end of everything.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.120
I would never be able to get this close to her again.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:12.080
If it was just the two of us...

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.910
...I wonder if I could have held myself back?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.540
I wonder if Yuu is already asleep?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.200
I wanted to see her sleeping face...

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.620
But this might be for the best.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.200
If I saw it, I might not be able to hold back anymore.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.540
If it was just the two of us...

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.000
...it would have been dangerous.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.700
To touch, or not to touch.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.120
It's not even a question.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:52.450
With Saeki-senpai here in the room,
I can't even think about it.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.080
I'm glad there are three of us.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.910
Good morning...

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.290
You seem tired.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:12.830
Good morning!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.830
Good morning.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:16.500
Is everyone here?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:17.450
Yep.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:21.660
Okay, let me introduce you to the person who
is coming to watch you rehearse today and tomorrow.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.120
We're gonna have an audience?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.290
Riko-sensei told us that the other day!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.580
Come on in.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:31.250
This is one of the members of the theater troupe I'm in,
his name is Tomoyuki Ichigaya.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.330
I'm Ichigaya, nice to meet you.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.580
Nice to meet you!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.620
All right, let's head outside.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:50.830
Okay.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.500
Okay...

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:54.700
How were we?

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:02.750
Well, there's a lot that can be improved,
but everyone in the council is new to this, right?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.660
I think you're doing great.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.950
Thank you very much.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:11.080
But to be honest, I'm surprised the Student Council
brought back the stage show.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.080
Huh?

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.450
I'm a former student here.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.120
From here?

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.080
Oh! Wait, are you...

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.370
...Yuki-kun?!

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.000
Good afternoon.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.330
You were a classmate of my sister's...

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.950
So, you remember me?

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:33.120
I guess we did visit your house pretty often
for Student Council business.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:35.370
It's been a long time!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.660
Hard to believe that little girl who always hid behind
her sister is now the Student Council president.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.000
Time flies.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.160
Let's make this show a success.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.410
Yeah!

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:05.950
Centroid of the Triangle

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:11.040
Lit Fuse

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:19.200
Do! Rei! Mi! Fa! So! La! Ti! Do!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:24.580
Do! Rei! Mi! Fa! So! La! Ti! Do!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.750
Everyone starts from the basics!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:24.370
If you want to act on the stage,
you'll have to practice for it!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.700
Yes sir!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.200
Your voice is really loud, great job.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.120
Thanks!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:32.040
But why are we practicing where
there are so many people around?

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.580
If you can't handle this, how are
you going handle a real audience?

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.580
Okay, belt it from the stomach!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:46.120
Do! Rei! Mi! Fa! So! La! Ti! Do!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:54.120
Do! Rei! Mi! Fa! So! La! Ti! Do!

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.500
Hey, Touko! Is this what you call training?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.580
Yuu! Keep it up!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.200
It would be nice to use a spotlight
for this flashback scene.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.410
We need to check what lighting equipment
is available in the gym.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:05.790
Sound equipment, too.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:08.080
Oh, we should be able to use a spotlight!

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:12.620
Here, this is a list of available equipment
that I made myself.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.370
You're always so prepared, Nanami-san.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:19.620
I also think it would be good to decide
what we need for props and outfits.

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:20.870
Yeah, you're right.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:26.000
I've already talked with the arts and crafts club
about helping out, so we should let them know soon.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:26.910
Okay.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.120
You're quite the hard worker.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.580
Well, this was originally my idea.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:40.410
I always thought the council president just took it easy
and ordered everyone else around.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:42.830
U-um!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.660
Ichigaya-kun?

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.410
What do you think about this part?

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.750
Yeah, that scene needs some work.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.290
Hey, Maki?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.250
What do you think about Riko-sensei and Ichigaya-san?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:58.250
They seem really close.
I wonder what kind of relationship they have?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.540
Right? I'm just itching to ask!

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.160
Ichigaya-san!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.290
What's up?

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:08.160
What's the REAL story behind you and Riko-sensei?

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:09.370
Huh?!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.790
I told you, we're both members
of the same theater troupe!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.700
There's nothing more for you to read into!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.700
I'm already in a relationship, you know.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.040
That's no fun.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.450
You idiot.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.250
Thank you very much!

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.370
See you all tomorrow.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.410
I'm going to see him off!

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:39.290
Senpai?

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.160
You don't have to see me off.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:44.870
I'd like to.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.040
Um...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:51.870
Huh?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.660
Something you said earlier got me curious.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.040
What's that?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.330
You were talking about
the Student Council president's job.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:03.830
When my sister was in the council... what was she like?

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.120
Let me think...

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.080
She was certainly a handful for us.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:16.200
Always pushing the work onto me
and the other members of the council.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.700
But she loved doing all the public speeches
and taking the credit,

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:24.200
so everyone who saw her from the outside
thought she was really top-class.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:38.330
One time, Mio didn't finish her summer homework
and made the rest of us help her get it done.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:46.000
We'd copy her handwriting and even make
the same mistakes she would, to not raise suspicion.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:53.580
It was tough, but actually pretty fun.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:57.500
Even though we were all just kind
of dragged along by her,

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.370
we all really liked her, for some reason.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.250
The sister I knew...

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:25.330
She was perfect and capable of doing anything,
so I looked up to her.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:30.330
I never saw her like you did.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:32.700
I see.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:36.910
I suppose, in front of you,
she wanted to appear that way.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:41.250
But from my perspective,
I can't even imagine Mio as being perfect.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.200
You're a far more impressive
Student Council president than she was.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:49.620
To be honest...

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:55.330
Although you’re her sister,
you don't seem very similar to Mio at all.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.450
Fireworks!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.290
Thanks so much, Riko-sensei!

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.700
Riko-sensei, I love you!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.040
I told you, it's "Hakozaki-sensei"!

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:20.250
The truth is that I didn't buy them,
they were actually Miyako's idea.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.500
You should take these!

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.870
Nanami-senpai, look at all the fireworks!

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:32.160
Senpai?

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.250
She's so kind...

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.790
I just want to melt in her arms.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.040
But it's hard to tell how much she'd let me have my way.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.950
I fear that if I keep bathing myself
in her kindness, then she might...

00:17:58.950 --> 00:17:59.870
...dry up.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:06.160
Wow, there's so many different kinds!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.330
I wonder which one we should set off first?

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.160
Okay, okay! We've got an overabundance of fireworks!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.160
So unless we double up, we'll never get through them all!

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.790
I don't think we need to use all of them tonight...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:25.450
No way! Fireworks aren't fireworks
unless you set off 'em off all at once!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.160
Okay!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:35.660
Let's use these to write something in the air.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.790
What should we write?

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.500
Well, how about "Student Council"?

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:40.080
Isn't that a little too complicated?

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.870
Fine, how about "I love you"!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.790
Who are you going to confess to?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.750
Then, you come up with something!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.410
Make sure you stay near the water buckets!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.330
Yes ma'am.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.540
I'm starting to feel like a babysitter...

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:10.750
All right, Maki. Let's compete to see
whose fireworks last the longest!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.790
Sure.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.450
Now is the time for my secret weapon... combine!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:15.450
Touko.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:19.500
Sticking two together? That's not fair.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.620
Those youngsters sure have a lot of energy!

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:22.290
When did you become such a grandma?

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.950
Well, we are getting pretty old.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.830
Here we go!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.120
Older than them, anyway.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.830
Huh? That's it?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.540
What?

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.950
It didn't work as I hoped...

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.250
You realize the stronger they are, the faster they die out.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.200
Maybe these are more our speed?

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.540
Oh, I made it fall again.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.910
It's difficult to keep these going until the end.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.790
You have to stay calm and quiet.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.290
Did something happen?

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:07.540
Not really.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.500
Did you talk about something... with Ichigaya-san?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.620
Ichigaya-san is...

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:39.580
I heard that Ichigaya-san is an old member
of our Student Council.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:46.120
Did he talk about your sister?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.250
The person who Ichigaya-san knew...

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.540
...was totally different from the sister that I knew.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.870
I don't know what to do anymore.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.580
I see.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.120
Whoa! It's hot! Too hot!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.000
You're getting too close!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.330
You knew, Sayaka? About my sister...

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.580
Yeah, after I looked into the council
from seven years ago.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.540
I'm sorry.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.120
It's okay.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.950
I don't mind if you know, Sayaka.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:42.540
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:54.620
Sure.

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.580
I want to know, but I also don't

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:22.500
I like things the way they are now (The way they are now)

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:26.120
If you must answer "Yes" or "No"

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:34.250
Then I hope tomorrow never ever comes

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:52.750
That world was far away from me, or so I thought (Or so I thought)

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:59.620
These feelings shouldn't apply to me (Shouldn't apply to me)

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:01.540
But for you, they could be possible

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.410
Showing what's actually inside my heart

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:07.040
Because nothing will ever change it

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.910
I've figured out where my heart is

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:10.750
It's about to become pretty uncomfortable

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:13.830
Now that the wind's flow has suddenly changed

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:16.450
What will tomorrow become?

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:18.200
Soon it will bloom into you

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:21.830
Take a peek at how delicate I am inside

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:23.750
I've got butterflies in my stomach

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.580
If you found out about my feelings

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:29.370
I wonder if you'll run away?
